{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >ROVA is a cozy space-rover photography game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Help a new space colony conduct research on large spherical planets, by documenting <br>elements of alien worlds through photography. ROVA is a game about discovery and <br>exploration. <br> <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2930130/extras/23da0150c33c1d93827318d58edc5e91.poster.avif?t=1763399132\" width=600 height=170 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2930130/extras/23da0150c33c1d93827318d58edc5e91.webm?t=1763399132\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2930130/extras/23da0150c33c1d93827318d58edc5e91.mp4?t=1763399132\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>SPACE-ROVA PHOTOGRAPHY</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Photograph EVERYTHING, with your very own ROVA.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2930130/extras/23d02cf3ba699cfb04fb065997812081.poster.avif?t=1763399132\" width=600 height=170 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2930130/extras/23d02cf3ba699cfb04fb065997812081.webm?t=1763399132\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2930130/extras/23d02cf3ba699cfb04fb065997812081.mp4?t=1763399132\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>FULLY EXPLORABLE PLANETS</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore entire alien planets packed with research opportunities, just waiting to be discovered <br>through your photography.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2930130/extras/a09243ed03c720224eff8c5b1ee0b5b0.poster.avif?t=1763399132\" width=600 height=170 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2930130/extras/a09243ed03c720224eff8c5b1ee0b5b0.webm?t=1763399132\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2930130/extras/a09243ed03c720224eff8c5b1ee0b5b0.mp4?t=1763399132\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>RESEARCH DATABASE</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each photo you take expands the Research Database. Can you find everything there is <br>to discover?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2930130/extras/1855f1302aa8bcdd7714a8448f58a090.poster.avif?t=1763399132\" width=600 height=170 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2930130/extras/1855f1302aa8bcdd7714a8448f58a090.webm?t=1763399132\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2930130/extras/1855f1302aa8bcdd7714a8448f58a090.mp4?t=1763399132\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><strong>COLONIST CUSTOMISATION</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Space research in style. Customise the colony with a range of clothing options.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2930130/extras/b75eee0c2bfba5e69be3308242ae7e44.poster.avif?t=1763399132\" width=600 height=170 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2930130/extras/b75eee0c2bfba5e69be3308242ae7e44.webm?t=1763399132\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2930130/extras/b75eee0c2bfba5e69be3308242ae7e44.mp4?t=1763399132\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Space-ROVA photography </p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Research Database: grows with every photo you take!</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Multiple planets with their own unique biomes and ecosystems</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Save your photos to your PC. Perfect for desktop backgrounds or <br>sharing with friends!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Colonist customization</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > 'Observation/study mode' - listen to lofi songs whilst observing colonists perform <br>their daily routines </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2930130?t=1763399132","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2930130/8cbebc543de0cdae4426eee16fca769e685f8dab/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1763399132","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2930130/78840a24f7918491a24eece43fb7f5ac0a4c67bd/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1763399132","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2930130/78840a24f7918491a24eece43fb7f5ac0a4c67bd/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1763399132","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","demos":[{"appid":3147020,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_parag